# Segment 6 of the recording: the two summary tables from evals/report.md.
Output tools/record/out/06-tables.mp4
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 30
Sleep 1s
Type "uv run python tools/record/tables.py"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@60s /nvidia/
Sleep 14s
